            <div xml:id="d314-a2">

                <pb facs="0548" n="486" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg486"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure No. 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Reply of the Emperor to the address of the diplomatic
                        corps, January</hi> 1, 1878.</head>
                <p>I am glad to receive the congratulations of your excellencies at the favorable
                    season of the new year, and rejoice to celebrate this happy occasion along with
                    the sovereigns and presidents of the friendly powers.</p>
                <p>I am glad, also, that your excellencies have entered upon the new year in
                    health.</p>
            </div>
